<title>POLAND: ELPO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELPO MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.21 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.04 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Sales		    1.51 vs   1.06</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.85 vs   0.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.15 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.34 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Sales		    7.52 vs   5.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Elpo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
